{"id":15,"name":"الحجر","transliteration":"Al-Hijr","translation_fr":"Al-Hijr","translation_en":"The Rocky Tract","type":"meccan","total_verses":99,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"الٓرۚ تِلۡكَ ءَايَٰتُ ٱلۡكِتَٰبِ وَقُرۡءَانٖ مُّبِينٖ","translation_fr":"Alif, Lâm, Râ. Voici les versets du Livre et d'une Lecture explicite","translation_en":"Alif, Lam, Ra. These are the verses of the Book and a clear Qur'an","transliteration":"Aliflamra tilka ayatu alkitabi waquranin mubeenin"},{"id":2,"text":"رُّبَمَا يَوَدُّ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُواْ لَوۡ كَانُواْ مُسۡلِمِينَ","translation_fr":"[Le Jour du Jugement Dernier] les mécréants voudraient avoir été Musulmans [soumis]","translation_en":"Perhaps those who disbelieve will wish that they had been Muslims","transliteration":"Rubama yawaddu allatheena kafaroo law kanoo muslimeena"},{"id":3,"text":"ذَرۡهُمۡ يَأۡكُلُواْ وَيَتَمَتَّعُواْ وَيُلۡهِهِمُ ٱلۡأَمَلُۖ فَسَوۡفَ يَعۡلَمُونَ","translation_fr":"Laisse-les manger, jouir (un temps), et être distraits par l'espoir; car bientôt ils sauront","translation_en":"Let them eat and enjoy themselves and be diverted by [false] hope, for they are going to know","transliteration":"Tharhum yakuloo wayatamattaAAoo wayulhihimu alamalu fasawfa yaAAlamoona"},{"id":4,"text":"وَمَآ أَهۡلَكۡنَا مِن قَرۡيَةٍ إِلَّا وَلَهَا كِتَابٞ مَّعۡلُومٞ","translation_fr":"Or Nous ne détruisons aucune cité sans qu'elle n'ait eu [un terme fixé en] une Ecriture connue","translation_en":"And We did not destroy any city but that for it was a known decree","transliteration":"Wama ahlakna min qaryatin illa walaha kitabun maAAloomun"},{"id":5,"text":"مَّا تَسۡبِقُ مِنۡ أُمَّةٍ أَجَلَهَا وَمَا يَسۡتَـٔۡخِرُونَ","translation_fr":"Nulle communauté ne devance son terme, ni ne le retarde","translation_en":"No nation will precede its term, nor will they remain thereafter","transliteration":"Ma tasbiqu min ommatin ajalaha wama yastakhiroona"},{"id":6,"text":"وَقَالُواْ يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِي نُزِّلَ عَلَيۡهِ ٱلذِّكۡرُ إِنَّكَ لَمَجۡنُونٞ","translation_fr":"Et ils (les mecquois) disent: «O toi sur qui on a fait descendre le Coran, tu es certainement fou","translation_en":"And they say, \"O you upon whom the message has been sent down, indeed you are mad","transliteration":"Waqaloo ya ayyuha allathee nuzzila AAalayhi alththikru innaka lamajnoonun"},{"id":7,"text":"لَّوۡمَا تَأۡتِينَا بِٱلۡمَلَـٰٓئِكَةِ إِن كُنتَ مِنَ ٱلصَّـٰدِقِينَ","translation_fr":"Pourquoi ne nous es-tu pas venu avec les Anges, si tu es du nombre des véridiques?»","translation_en":"Why do you not bring us the angels, if you should be among the truthful","transliteration":"Law ma tateena bialmalaikati in kunta mina alssadiqeena"},{"id":8,"text":"مَا نُنَزِّلُ ٱلۡمَلَـٰٓئِكَةَ إِلَّا بِٱلۡحَقِّ وَمَا كَانُوٓاْ إِذٗا مُّنظَرِينَ","translation_fr":"Nous ne faisons descendre les Anges qu'avec la vérité; et alors, il ne leur sera pas accordé de répit [à ces impies]","translation_en":"We do not send down the angels except with truth; and the disbelievers would not then be reprieved","transliteration":"Ma nunazzilu almalaikata illa bialhaqqi wama kanoo ithan munthareena"},{"id":9,"text":"إِنَّا نَحۡنُ نَزَّلۡنَا ٱلذِّكۡرَ وَإِنَّا لَهُۥ لَحَٰفِظُونَ","translation_fr":"En vérité c'est Nous qui avons fait descendre le Coran, et c'est Nous qui en sommes gardien","translation_en":"Indeed, it is We who sent down the Qur'an and indeed, We will be its guardian","transliteration":"Inna nahnu nazzalna alththikra wainna lahu lahafithoona"},{"id":10,"text":"وَلَقَدۡ أَرۡسَلۡنَا مِن قَبۡلِكَ فِي شِيَعِ ٱلۡأَوَّلِينَ","translation_fr":"Et nous avons certes envoyé, avant toi, [des Messagers] parmi les peuples des Anciens","translation_en":"And We had certainly sent [messengers] before you, [O Muhammad], among the sects of the former peoples","transliteration":"Walaqad arsalna min qablika fee shiyaAAi alawwaleena"},{"id":11,"text":"وَمَا يَأۡتِيهِم مِّن رَّسُولٍ إِلَّا كَانُواْ بِهِۦ يَسۡتَهۡزِءُونَ","translation_fr":"Et pas un Messager ne leur est venu sans qu'ils s'en soient moqués","translation_en":"And no messenger would come to them except that they ridiculed him","transliteration":"Wama yateehim min rasoolin illa kanoo bihi yastahzioona"},{"id":12,"text":"كَذَٰلِكَ نَسۡلُكُهُۥ فِي قُلُوبِ ٱلۡمُجۡرِمِينَ","translation_fr":"C'est ainsi que Nous faisons pénétrer (la mécréance) dans les cœurs des coupables","translation_en":"Thus do We insert denial into the hearts of the criminals","transliteration":"Kathalika naslukuhu fee quloobi almujrimeena"},{"id":13,"text":"لَا يُؤۡمِنُونَ بِهِۦ وَقَدۡ خَلَتۡ سُنَّةُ ٱلۡأَوَّلِينَ","translation_fr":"Ils ne croiront pas en lui [le Messager ou le Coran] bien que se soit accompli le sort traditionnel des anciens","translation_en":"They will not believe in it, while there has already occurred the precedent of the former peoples","transliteration":"La yuminoona bihi waqad khalat sunnatu alawwaleena"},{"id":14,"text":"وَلَوۡ فَتَحۡنَا عَلَيۡهِم بَابٗا مِّنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ فَظَلُّواْ فِيهِ يَعۡرُجُونَ","translation_fr":"Et même si Nous ouvrions pour eux une porte du ciel, et qu'ils pussent y monter","translation_en":"And [even] if We opened to them a gate from the heaven and they continued therein to ascend","transliteration":"Walaw fatahna AAalayhim baban mina alssamai fathalloo feehi yaAArujoona"},{"id":15,"text":"لَقَالُوٓاْ إِنَّمَا سُكِّرَتۡ أَبۡصَٰرُنَا بَلۡ نَحۡنُ قَوۡمٞ مَّسۡحُورُونَ","translation_fr":"ils diraient: «Vraiment nos yeux sont voilés. Mais plutôt, nous sommes des gens ensorcelés»","translation_en":"They would say, \"Our eyes have only been dazzled. Rather, we are a people affected by magic","transliteration":"Laqaloo innama sukkirat absaruna bal nahnu qawmun mashooroona"},{"id":16,"text":"وَلَقَدۡ جَعَلۡنَا فِي ٱلسَّمَآءِ بُرُوجٗا وَزَيَّنَّـٰهَا لِلنَّـٰظِرِينَ","translation_fr":"Certes Nous avons placé dans le ciel des constellations et Nous l'avons embelli pour ceux qui regardent","translation_en":"And We have placed within the heaven great stars and have beautified it for the observers","transliteration":"Walaqad jaAAalna fee alssamai buroojan wazayyannaha lilnnathireena"},{"id":17,"text":"وَحَفِظۡنَٰهَا مِن كُلِّ شَيۡطَٰنٖ رَّجِيمٍ","translation_fr":"Et Nous l'avons protégé contre tout diable banni","translation_en":"And We have protected it from every devil expelled [from the mercy of Allah]","transliteration":"Wahafithnaha min kulli shaytanin rajeemin"},{"id":18,"text":"إِلَّا مَنِ ٱسۡتَرَقَ ٱلسَّمۡعَ فَأَتۡبَعَهُۥ شِهَابٞ مُّبِينٞ","translation_fr":"A moins que l'un d'eux parvienne subrepticement à écouter, une flamme brillante alors le poursuit","translation_en":"Except one who steals a hearing and is pursued by a clear burning flame","transliteration":"Illa mani istaraqa alssamAAa faatbaAAahu shihabun mubeenun"},{"id":19,"text":"وَٱلۡأَرۡضَ مَدَدۡنَٰهَا وَأَلۡقَيۡنَا فِيهَا رَوَٰسِيَ وَأَنۢبَتۡنَا فِيهَا مِن كُلِّ شَيۡءٖ مَّوۡزُونٖ","translation_fr":"Et quant à la terre, Nous l'avons étalée et y avons placé des montagnes (immobiles) et y avons fait pousser toute chose harmonieusement proportionnée","translation_en":"And the earth - We have spread it and cast therein firmly set mountains and caused to grow therein [something] of every well-balanced thing","transliteration":"Waalarda madadnaha waalqayna feeha rawasiya waanbatna feeha min kulli shayin mawzoonin"},{"id":20,"text":"وَجَعَلۡنَا لَكُمۡ فِيهَا مَعَٰيِشَ وَمَن لَّسۡتُمۡ لَهُۥ بِرَٰزِقِينَ","translation_fr":"Et Nous y avons placé des vivres pour vous, et (placé aussi pour vous) des êtres que vous ne nourrissez pas","translation_en":"And We have made for you therein means of living and [for] those for whom you are not providers","transliteration":"WajaAAalna lakum feeha maAAayisha waman lastum lahu biraziqeena"},{"id":21,"text":"وَإِن مِّن شَيۡءٍ إِلَّا عِندَنَا خَزَآئِنُهُۥ وَمَا نُنَزِّلُهُۥٓ إِلَّا بِقَدَرٖ مَّعۡلُومٖ","translation_fr":"Et il n'est rien dont Nous n'ayons les réserves et Nous ne le faisons descendre que dans une mesure déterminée","translation_en":"And there is not a thing but that with Us are its depositories, and We do not send it down except according to a known measure","transliteration":"Wain min shayin illa AAindana khazainuhu wama nunazziluhu illa biqadarin maAAloomin"},{"id":22,"text":"وَأَرۡسَلۡنَا ٱلرِّيَٰحَ لَوَٰقِحَ فَأَنزَلۡنَا مِنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ مَآءٗ فَأَسۡقَيۡنَٰكُمُوهُ وَمَآ أَنتُمۡ لَهُۥ بِخَٰزِنِينَ","translation_fr":"Et Nous envoyons les vents fécondants; et Nous faisons alors descendre du ciel une eau dont Nous vous abreuvons et que vous n'êtes pas en mesure de conserver","translation_en":"And We have sent the fertilizing winds and sent down water from the sky and given you drink from it. And you are not its retainers","transliteration":"Waarsalna alrriyaha lawaqiha faanzalna mina alssamai maan faasqaynakumoohu wama antum lahu bikhazineena"},{"id":23,"text":"وَإِنَّا لَنَحۡنُ نُحۡيِۦ وَنُمِيتُ وَنَحۡنُ ٱلۡوَٰرِثُونَ","translation_fr":"Et c'est bien Nous qui donnons la vie et donnons la mort, et c'est Nous qui sommes l'héritier [de tout]","translation_en":"And indeed, it is We who give life and cause death, and We are the Inheritor","transliteration":"Wainna lanahnu nuhyee wanumeetu wanahnu alwarithoona"},{"id":24,"text":"وَلَقَدۡ عَلِمۡنَا ٱلۡمُسۡتَقۡدِمِينَ مِنكُمۡ وَلَقَدۡ عَلِمۡنَا ٱلۡمُسۡتَـٔۡخِرِينَ","translation_fr":"Et Nous connaissons certes ceux qui parmi vous ont avancé et Nous connaissons ceux qui tardent encore","translation_en":"And We have already known the preceding [generations] among you, and We have already known the later [ones to come]","transliteration":"Walaqad AAalimna almustaqdimeena minkum walaqad AAalimna almustakhireena"},{"id":25,"text":"وَإِنَّ رَبَّكَ هُوَ يَحۡشُرُهُمۡۚ إِنَّهُۥ حَكِيمٌ عَلِيمٞ","translation_fr":"Certes, c'est ton Seigneur qui les rassemblera. Car c'est Lui le Sage, l'Omniscient","translation_en":"And indeed, your Lord will gather them; indeed, He is Wise and Knowing","transliteration":"Wainna rabbaka huwa yahshuruhum innahu hakeemun AAaleemun"},{"id":26,"text":"وَلَقَدۡ خَلَقۡنَا ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ مِن صَلۡصَٰلٖ مِّنۡ حَمَإٖ مَّسۡنُونٖ","translation_fr":"Nous créâmes l'homme d'une argile crissante, extraite d'une boue malléable","translation_en":"And We did certainly create man out of clay from an altered black mud","transliteration":"Walaqad khalaqna alinsana min salsalin min hamain masnoonin"},{"id":27,"text":"وَٱلۡجَآنَّ خَلَقۡنَٰهُ مِن قَبۡلُ مِن نَّارِ ٱلسَّمُومِ","translation_fr":"Et quant au djinn, Nous l'avions auparavant créé d'un feu d'une chaleur ardente","translation_en":"And the jinn We created before from scorching fire","transliteration":"Waaljanna khalaqnahu min qablu min nari alssamoomi"},{"id":28,"text":"وَإِذۡ قَالَ رَبُّكَ لِلۡمَلَـٰٓئِكَةِ إِنِّي خَٰلِقُۢ بَشَرٗا مِّن صَلۡصَٰلٖ مِّنۡ حَمَإٖ مَّسۡنُونٖ","translation_fr":"Et lorsque ton Seigneur dit aux Anges: «Je vais créer un homme d'argile crissante, extraite d'une boue malléable","translation_en":"And [mention, O Muhammad], when your Lord said to the angels, \"I will create a human being out of clay from an altered black mud","transliteration":"Waith qala rabbuka lilmalaikati innee khaliqun basharan min salsalin min hamain masnoonin"},{"id":29,"text":"فَإِذَا سَوَّيۡتُهُۥ وَنَفَخۡتُ فِيهِ مِن رُّوحِي فَقَعُواْ لَهُۥ سَٰجِدِينَ","translation_fr":"et dès que Je l'aurai harmonieusement formé et lui aurai insufflé Mon souffle de vie, jetez-vous alors, prosternés devant lui»","translation_en":"And when I have proportioned him and breathed into him of My [created] soul, then fall down to him in prostration","transliteration":"Faitha sawwaytuhu wanafakhtu feehi min roohee faqaAAoo lahu sajideena"},{"id":30,"text":"فَسَجَدَ ٱلۡمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ كُلُّهُمۡ أَجۡمَعُونَ","translation_fr":"Alors, les Anges se prosternèrent tous ensemble","translation_en":"So the angels prostrated - all of them entirely","transliteration":"Fasajada almalaikatu kulluhum ajmaAAoona"},{"id":31,"text":"إِلَّآ إِبۡلِيسَ أَبَىٰٓ أَن يَكُونَ مَعَ ٱلسَّـٰجِدِينَ","translation_fr":"excepté Iblis qui refusa d'être avec les prosternés","translation_en":"Except Iblees, he refused to be with those who prostrated","transliteration":"Illa ibleesa aba an yakoona maAAa alssajideena"},{"id":32,"text":"قَالَ يَـٰٓإِبۡلِيسُ مَا لَكَ أَلَّا تَكُونَ مَعَ ٱلسَّـٰجِدِينَ","translation_fr":"Alors [Allah] dit: «O Iblis, pourquoi n'es-tu pas au nombre des prosternés?»","translation_en":"[Allah] said, O Iblees, what is [the matter] with you that you are not with those who prostrate","transliteration":"Qala ya ibleesu ma laka alla takoona maAAa alssajideena"},{"id":33,"text":"قَالَ لَمۡ أَكُن لِّأَسۡجُدَ لِبَشَرٍ خَلَقۡتَهُۥ مِن صَلۡصَٰلٖ مِّنۡ حَمَإٖ مَّسۡنُونٖ","translation_fr":"Il dit: «Je ne puis me prosterner devant un homme que Tu as créé d'argile crissante, extraite d'une boue malléable»","translation_en":"He said, \"Never would I prostrate to a human whom You created out of clay from an altered black mud","transliteration":"Qala lam akun liasjuda libasharin khalaqtahu min salsalin min hamain masnoonin"},{"id":34,"text":"قَالَ فَٱخۡرُجۡ مِنۡهَا فَإِنَّكَ رَجِيمٞ","translation_fr":"Et [Allah] dit: «Sors de là [du Paradis], car te voilà banni","translation_en":"[Allah] said, \"Then get out of it, for indeed, you are expelled","transliteration":"Qala faokhruj minha fainnaka rajeemun"},{"id":35,"text":"وَإِنَّ عَلَيۡكَ ٱللَّعۡنَةَ إِلَىٰ يَوۡمِ ٱلدِّينِ","translation_fr":"Et malédiction sur toi, jusqu'au Jour de la rétribution!»","translation_en":"And indeed, upon you is the curse until the Day of Recompense","transliteration":"Wainna AAalayka allaAAnata ila yawmi alddeeni"},{"id":36,"text":"قَالَ رَبِّ فَأَنظِرۡنِيٓ إِلَىٰ يَوۡمِ يُبۡعَثُونَ","translation_fr":"Il dit: «O mon Seigneur, donne-moi donc un délai jusqu'au jour où ils (les gens) seront ressuscités»","translation_en":"He said, \"My Lord, then reprieve me until the Day they are resurrected","transliteration":"Qala rabbi faanthirnee ila yawmi yubAAathoona"},{"id":37,"text":"قَالَ فَإِنَّكَ مِنَ ٱلۡمُنظَرِينَ","translation_fr":"[Allah] dit: «tu es de ceux à qui ce délai est accordé","translation_en":"[Allah] said, \"So indeed, you are of those reprieved","transliteration":"Qala fainnaka mina almunthareena"},{"id":38,"text":"إِلَىٰ يَوۡمِ ٱلۡوَقۡتِ ٱلۡمَعۡلُومِ","translation_fr":"jusqu'au jour de l'instant connu» [d'Allah]","translation_en":"Until the Day of the time well-known","transliteration":"Ila yawmi alwaqti almaAAloomi"},{"id":39,"text":"قَالَ رَبِّ بِمَآ أَغۡوَيۡتَنِي لَأُزَيِّنَنَّ لَهُمۡ فِي ٱلۡأَرۡضِ وَلَأُغۡوِيَنَّهُمۡ أَجۡمَعِينَ","translation_fr":"Il dit: «O mon Seigneur, parce que Tu m'as induit en erreur, eh bien je leur enjoliverai la vie sur terre et les égarerai tous","translation_en":"[Iblees] said, \"My Lord, because You have put me in error, I will surely make [disobedience] attractive to them on earth, and I will mislead them all","transliteration":"Qala rabbi bima aghwaytanee laozayyinanna lahum fee alardi walaoghwiyannahum ajmaAAeena"},{"id":40,"text":"إِلَّا عِبَادَكَ مِنۡهُمُ ٱلۡمُخۡلَصِينَ","translation_fr":"à l'exception, parmi eux, de Tes serviteurs élus.»","translation_en":"Except, among them, Your chosen servants","transliteration":"Illa AAibadaka minhumu almukhlaseena"},{"id":41,"text":"قَالَ هَٰذَا صِرَٰطٌ عَلَيَّ مُسۡتَقِيمٌ","translation_fr":"«[Allah] dit: voici une voie droite [qui mène] vers Moi","translation_en":"[Allah] said, \"This is a path [of return] to Me [that is] straight","transliteration":"Qala hatha siratun AAalayya mustaqeemun"},{"id":42,"text":"إِنَّ عِبَادِي لَيۡسَ لَكَ عَلَيۡهِمۡ سُلۡطَٰنٌ إِلَّا مَنِ ٱتَّبَعَكَ مِنَ ٱلۡغَاوِينَ","translation_fr":"Sur Mes serviteurs tu n'auras aucune autorité, excepté sur celui qui te suivra parmi les dévoyés","translation_en":"Indeed, My servants - no authority will you have over them, except those who follow you of the deviators","transliteration":"Inna AAibadee laysa laka AAalayhim sultanun illa mani ittabaAAaka mina alghaweena"},{"id":43,"text":"وَإِنَّ جَهَنَّمَ لَمَوۡعِدُهُمۡ أَجۡمَعِينَ","translation_fr":"Et l'Enfer sera sûrement leur lieu de rendez-vous à tous","translation_en":"And indeed, Hell is the promised place for them all","transliteration":"Wainna jahannama lamawAAiduhum ajmaAAeena"},{"id":44,"text":"لَهَا سَبۡعَةُ أَبۡوَٰبٖ لِّكُلِّ بَابٖ مِّنۡهُمۡ جُزۡءٞ مَّقۡسُومٌ","translation_fr":"Il a sept portes; et chaque porte en a sa part déterminée»","translation_en":"It has seven gates; for every gate is of them a portion designated","transliteration":"Laha sabAAatu abwabin likulli babin minhum juzon maqsoomun"},{"id":45,"text":"إِنَّ ٱلۡمُتَّقِينَ فِي جَنَّـٰتٖ وَعُيُونٍ","translation_fr":"Certes, les pieux seront dans des jardins avec des sources","translation_en":"Indeed, the righteous will be within gardens and springs","transliteration":"Inna almuttaqeena fee jannatin waAAuyoonin"},{"id":46,"text":"ٱدۡخُلُوهَا بِسَلَٰمٍ ءَامِنِينَ","translation_fr":"«Entrez-y en paix et en sécurité»","translation_en":"[Having been told], \"Enter it in peace, safe [and secure]","transliteration":"Odkhulooha bisalamin amineena"},{"id":47,"text":"وَنَزَعۡنَا مَا فِي صُدُورِهِم مِّنۡ غِلٍّ إِخۡوَٰنًا عَلَىٰ سُرُرٖ مُّتَقَٰبِلِينَ","translation_fr":"Et Nous aurons arraché toute rancune de leurs poitrines: et ils se sentiront frères, faisant face les uns aux autres sur des lits","translation_en":"And We will remove whatever is in their breasts of resentment, [so they will be] brothers, on thrones facing each other","transliteration":"WanazaAAna ma fee sudoorihim min ghillin ikhwanan AAala sururin mutaqabileena"},{"id":48,"text":"لَا يَمَسُّهُمۡ فِيهَا نَصَبٞ وَمَا هُم مِّنۡهَا بِمُخۡرَجِينَ","translation_fr":"Nulle fatigue ne les y touchera. Et on ne les en fera pas sortir","translation_en":"No fatigue will touch them therein, nor from it will they [ever] be removed","transliteration":"La yamassuhum feeha nasabun wama hum minha bimukhrajeena"},{"id":49,"text":"۞نَبِّئۡ عِبَادِيٓ أَنِّيٓ أَنَا ٱلۡغَفُورُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ","translation_fr":"Informe Mes serviteurs que c'est Moi le Pardonneur, le Très Miséricordieux","translation_en":"[O Muhammad], inform My servants that it is I who am the Forgiving, the Merciful","transliteration":"Nabbi AAibadee annee ana alghafooru alrraheemu"},{"id":50,"text":"وَأَنَّ عَذَابِي هُوَ ٱلۡعَذَابُ ٱلۡأَلِيمُ","translation_fr":"et que Mon châtiment est certes le châtiment douloureux","translation_en":"And that it is My punishment which is the painful punishment","transliteration":"Wa anna AAathabee huwa alAAathabu alaleemu"},{"id":51,"text":"وَنَبِّئۡهُمۡ عَن ضَيۡفِ إِبۡرَٰهِيمَ","translation_fr":"Et informe-les au sujet des hôtes d'Abraham","translation_en":"And inform them about the guests of Abraham","transliteration":"Wanabbihum AAan dayfi ibraheema"},{"id":52,"text":"إِذۡ دَخَلُواْ عَلَيۡهِ فَقَالُواْ سَلَٰمٗا قَالَ إِنَّا مِنكُمۡ وَجِلُونَ","translation_fr":"Quand ils entrèrent chez lui et dirent: «Salâm» - Il dit: «Nous avons peur de vous»","translation_en":"When they entered upon him and said, \"Peace.\" [Abraham] said, \"Indeed, we are fearful of you","transliteration":"Ith dakhaloo AAalayhi faqaloo salaman qala inna minkum wajiloona"},{"id":53,"text":"قَالُواْ لَا تَوۡجَلۡ إِنَّا نُبَشِّرُكَ بِغُلَٰمٍ عَلِيمٖ","translation_fr":"Ils dirent: «N'aie pas peur! Nous t'annonçons une bonne nouvelle, [la naissance] d'un garçon plein de savoir»","translation_en":"[The angels] said, \"Fear not. Indeed, we give you good tidings of a learned boy","transliteration":"Qaloo la tawjal inna nubashshiruka bighulamin AAaleemin"},{"id":54,"text":"قَالَ أَبَشَّرۡتُمُونِي عَلَىٰٓ أَن مَّسَّنِيَ ٱلۡكِبَرُ فَبِمَ تُبَشِّرُونَ","translation_fr":"Il dit: «M'annoncez-vous [cette nouvelle] alors que la vieillesse m'a touché? Que m'annoncez-vous donc?»","translation_en":"He said, \"Have you given me good tidings although old age has come upon me? Then of what [wonder] do you inform","transliteration":"Qala abashshartumoonee AAala an massaniya alkibaru fabima tubashshirooni"},{"id":55,"text":"قَالُواْ بَشَّرۡنَٰكَ بِٱلۡحَقِّ فَلَا تَكُن مِّنَ ٱلۡقَٰنِطِينَ","translation_fr":"Ils dirent: «Nous t'annonçons la vérité. Ne sois donc pas de ceux qui désespèrent»","translation_en":"They said, \"We have given you good tidings in truth, so do not be of the despairing","transliteration":"Qaloo bashsharnaka bialhaqqi fala takun mina alqaniteena"},{"id":56,"text":"قَالَ وَمَن يَقۡنَطُ مِن رَّحۡمَةِ رَبِّهِۦٓ إِلَّا ٱلضَّآلُّونَ","translation_fr":"Il dit: «Et qui désespère de la miséricorde de son Seigneur, sinon les égarés?»","translation_en":"He said, \"And who despairs of the mercy of his Lord except for those astray","transliteration":"Qala waman yaqnatu min rahmati rabbihi illa alddalloona"},{"id":57,"text":"قَالَ فَمَا خَطۡبُكُمۡ أَيُّهَا ٱلۡمُرۡسَلُونَ","translation_fr":"Et il [leur] dit: «Que voulez-vous, ô envoyés d'Allah?»","translation_en":"[Abraham] said, \"Then what is your business [here], O messengers","transliteration":"Qala fama khatbukum ayyuha almursaloona"},{"id":58,"text":"قَالُوٓاْ إِنَّآ أُرۡسِلۡنَآ إِلَىٰ قَوۡمٖ مُّجۡرِمِينَ","translation_fr":"Ils dirent: «En vérité, nous sommes envoyés à des gens criminels","translation_en":"They said, \"Indeed, we have been sent to a people of criminals","transliteration":"Qaloo inna orsilna ila qawmin mujrimeena"},{"id":59,"text":"إِلَّآ ءَالَ لُوطٍ إِنَّا لَمُنَجُّوهُمۡ أَجۡمَعِينَ","translation_fr":"à l'exception de la famille de Lot que nous sauverons tous","translation_en":"Except the family of Lot; indeed, we will save them all","transliteration":"Illa ala lootin inna lamunajjoohum ajmaAAeena"},{"id":60,"text":"إِلَّا ٱمۡرَأَتَهُۥ قَدَّرۡنَآ إِنَّهَا لَمِنَ ٱلۡغَٰبِرِينَ","translation_fr":"sauf sa femme.«Nous (Allah) avions déterminé qu'elle sera du nombre des exterminés","translation_en":"Except his wife.\" Allah decreed that she is of those who remain behind","transliteration":"Illa imraatahu qaddarna innaha lamina alghabireena"},{"id":61,"text":"فَلَمَّا جَآءَ ءَالَ لُوطٍ ٱلۡمُرۡسَلُونَ","translation_fr":"Puis lorsque les envoyés vinrent auprès de la famille de Lot","translation_en":"And when the messengers came to the family of Lot","transliteration":"Falamma jaa ala lootin almursaloona"},{"id":62,"text":"قَالَ إِنَّكُمۡ قَوۡمٞ مُّنكَرُونَ","translation_fr":"celui-ci dit: «Vous êtes [pour moi] des gens inconnus»","translation_en":"He said, \"Indeed, you are people unknown","transliteration":"Qala innakum qawmun munkaroona"},{"id":63,"text":"قَالُواْ بَلۡ جِئۡنَٰكَ بِمَا كَانُواْ فِيهِ يَمۡتَرُونَ","translation_fr":"Ils dirent: «Nous sommes plutôt venus à toi en apportant (le châtiment) à propos duquel ils doutaient","translation_en":"They said, \"But we have come to you with that about which they were disputing","transliteration":"Qaloo bal jinaka bima kanoo feehi yamtaroona"},{"id":64,"text":"وَأَتَيۡنَٰكَ بِٱلۡحَقِّ وَإِنَّا لَصَٰدِقُونَ","translation_fr":"Et nous venons à toi avec la vérité. Et nous sommes véridiques","translation_en":"And we have come to you with truth, and indeed, we are truthful","transliteration":"Waataynaka bialhaqqi wainna lasadiqoona"},{"id":65,"text":"فَأَسۡرِ بِأَهۡلِكَ بِقِطۡعٖ مِّنَ ٱلَّيۡلِ وَٱتَّبِعۡ أَدۡبَٰرَهُمۡ وَلَا يَلۡتَفِتۡ مِنكُمۡ أَحَدٞ وَٱمۡضُواْ حَيۡثُ تُؤۡمَرُونَ","translation_fr":"Pars donc avec ta famille en parie de nuit et suis leurs arrières; et que nul d'entre vous ne se retourne. Et allez là où on vous le commande»","translation_en":"So set out with your family during a portion of the night and follow behind them and let not anyone among you look back and continue on to where you are commanded","transliteration":"Faasri biahlika biqitAAin mina allayli waittabiAA adbarahum wala yaltafit minkum ahadun waimdoo haythu tumaroona"},{"id":66,"text":"وَقَضَيۡنَآ إِلَيۡهِ ذَٰلِكَ ٱلۡأَمۡرَ أَنَّ دَابِرَ هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ مَقۡطُوعٞ مُّصۡبِحِينَ","translation_fr":"Et Nous lui annonçâmes cet ordre: que ces gens-là, au matin, seront anéantis jusqu'au dernier","translation_en":"And We conveyed to him [the decree] of that matter: that those [sinners] would be eliminated by early morning","transliteration":"Waqadayna ilayhi thalika alamra anna dabira haolai maqtooAAun musbiheena"},{"id":67,"text":"وَجَآءَ أَهۡلُ ٱلۡمَدِينَةِ يَسۡتَبۡشِرُونَ","translation_fr":"Et les habitants de la ville (Sodome) vinrent [à lui] dans la joie","translation_en":"And the people of the city came rejoicing","transliteration":"Wajaa ahlu almadeenati yastabshiroona"},{"id":68,"text":"قَالَ إِنَّ هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ ضَيۡفِي فَلَا تَفۡضَحُونِ","translation_fr":"Il dit: «Ceux-ci sont mes hôtes, ne me déshonorez donc pas","translation_en":"[Lot] said, \"Indeed, these are my guests, so do not shame me","transliteration":"Qala inna haolai dayfee fala tafdahooni"},{"id":69,"text":"وَٱتَّقُواْ ٱللَّهَ وَلَا تُخۡزُونِ","translation_fr":"Et craignez Allah. Et ne me couvrez pas d'ignominie.»","translation_en":"And fear Allah and do not disgrace me","transliteration":"Waittaqoo Allaha wala tukhzooni"},{"id":70,"text":"قَالُوٓاْ أَوَلَمۡ نَنۡهَكَ عَنِ ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","translation_fr":"Ils dirent: «Ne t'avions-nous pas interdit de [recevoir] du monde?»","translation_en":"They said, \"Have we not forbidden you from [protecting] people","transliteration":"Qaloo awalam nanhaka AAani alAAalameena"},{"id":71,"text":"قَالَ هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ بَنَاتِيٓ إِن كُنتُمۡ فَٰعِلِينَ","translation_fr":"Il dit: «Voici mes filles, si vous voulez faire [quelque chose]!»","translation_en":"[Lot] said, \"These are my daughters - if you would be doers [of lawful marriage]","transliteration":"Qala haolai banatee in kuntum faAAileena"},{"id":72,"text":"لَعَمۡرُكَ إِنَّهُمۡ لَفِي سَكۡرَتِهِمۡ يَعۡمَهُونَ","translation_fr":"Par ta vie! ils se confondaient dans leur délire","translation_en":"By your life, [O Muhammad], indeed they were, in their intoxication, wandering blindly","transliteration":"LaAAamruka innahum lafee sakratihim yaAAmahoona"},{"id":73,"text":"فَأَخَذَتۡهُمُ ٱلصَّيۡحَةُ مُشۡرِقِينَ","translation_fr":"Alors, au lever du soleil le Cri (la catastrophe) les saisit","translation_en":"So the shriek seized them at sunrise","transliteration":"Faakhathathumu alssayhatu mushriqeena"},{"id":74,"text":"فَجَعَلۡنَا عَٰلِيَهَا سَافِلَهَا وَأَمۡطَرۡنَا عَلَيۡهِمۡ حِجَارَةٗ مِّن سِجِّيلٍ","translation_fr":"Et Nous renversâmes [la ville] de fond en comble et fîmes pleuvoir sur eux des pierres d'argile dure","translation_en":"And We made the highest part [of the city] its lowest and rained upon them stones of hard clay","transliteration":"FajaAAalna AAaliyaha safilaha waamtarna AAalayhim hijaratan min sijjeelin"},{"id":75,"text":"إِنَّ فِي ذَٰلِكَ لَأٓيَٰتٖ لِّلۡمُتَوَسِّمِينَ","translation_fr":"Voilà vraiment des preuves, pour ceux qui savent observer","translation_en":"Indeed in that are signs for those who discern","transliteration":"Inna fee thalika laayatin lilmutawassimeena"},{"id":76,"text":"وَإِنَّهَا لَبِسَبِيلٖ مُّقِيمٍ","translation_fr":"Elle [cette ville] se trouvait sur un chemin connu de tous","translation_en":"And indeed, those cities are [situated] on an established road","transliteration":"Wainnaha labisabeelin muqeemin"},{"id":77,"text":"إِنَّ فِي ذَٰلِكَ لَأٓيَةٗ لِّلۡمُؤۡمِنِينَ","translation_fr":"Voilà vraiment une exhortation pour les croyants","translation_en":"Indeed in that is a sign for the believers","transliteration":"Inna fee thalika laayatan lilmumineena"},{"id":78,"text":"وَإِن كَانَ أَصۡحَٰبُ ٱلۡأَيۡكَةِ لَظَٰلِمِينَ","translation_fr":"Et les habitants d'al-Aïka étaient [aussi] des injustes","translation_en":"And the companions of the thicket were [also] wrongdoers","transliteration":"Wain kana ashabu alaykati lathalimeena"},{"id":79,"text":"فَٱنتَقَمۡنَا مِنۡهُمۡ وَإِنَّهُمَا لَبِإِمَامٖ مُّبِينٖ","translation_fr":"Nous Nous sommes donc vengés d'eux. Et ces deux [cités], vraiment, sont sur une route bien évidente [que vous connaissez]","translation_en":"So We took retribution from them, and indeed, both [cities] are on a clear highway","transliteration":"Faintaqamna minhum wainnahuma labiimamin mubeenin"},{"id":80,"text":"وَلَقَدۡ كَذَّبَ أَصۡحَٰبُ ٱلۡحِجۡرِ ٱلۡمُرۡسَلِينَ","translation_fr":"Certes, les gens d'al-Hijr ont traité de menteurs les messagers","translation_en":"And certainly did the companions of Thamud deny the messengers","transliteration":"Walaqad kaththaba ashabu alhijri almursaleena"},{"id":81,"text":"وَءَاتَيۡنَٰهُمۡ ءَايَٰتِنَا فَكَانُواْ عَنۡهَا مُعۡرِضِينَ","translation_fr":"Nous leur avons montré Nos miracles, mais ils s'en étaient détournés","translation_en":"And We gave them Our signs, but from them they were turning away","transliteration":"Waataynahum ayatina fakanoo AAanha muAArideena"},{"id":82,"text":"وَكَانُواْ يَنۡحِتُونَ مِنَ ٱلۡجِبَالِ بُيُوتًا ءَامِنِينَ","translation_fr":"Et ils taillaient des maisons dans les montagnes, vivant en sécurité","translation_en":"And they used to carve from the mountains, houses, feeling secure","transliteration":"Wakanoo yanhitoona mina aljibali buyootan amineena"},{"id":83,"text":"فَأَخَذَتۡهُمُ ٱلصَّيۡحَةُ مُصۡبِحِينَ","translation_fr":"Puis, au matin, le Cri les saisit","translation_en":"But the shriek seized them at early morning","transliteration":"Faakhathathumu alssayhatu musbiheena"},{"id":84,"text":"فَمَآ أَغۡنَىٰ عَنۡهُم مَّا كَانُواْ يَكۡسِبُونَ","translation_fr":"Ce qu'ils avaient acquis ne leur a donc point profité","translation_en":"So nothing availed them [from] what they used to earn","transliteration":"Fama aghna AAanhum ma kanoo yaksiboona"},{"id":85,"text":"وَمَا خَلَقۡنَا ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَٱلۡأَرۡضَ وَمَا بَيۡنَهُمَآ إِلَّا بِٱلۡحَقِّۗ وَإِنَّ ٱلسَّاعَةَ لَأٓتِيَةٞۖ فَٱصۡفَحِ ٱلصَّفۡحَ ٱلۡجَمِيلَ","translation_fr":"Et Nous n'avons créé les cieux et la terre, et ce qui est entre eux, que pour une juste raison. Et l'Heure [sans aucun doute] arrivera! Pardonne-[leur] donc d'un beau pardon","translation_en":"And We have not created the heavens and earth and that between them except in truth. And indeed, the Hour is coming; so forgive with gracious forgiveness","transliteration":"Wama khalaqna alssamawati waalarda wama baynahuma illa bialhaqqi wainna alssaAAata laatiyatun faisfahi alssafha aljameela"},{"id":86,"text":"إِنَّ رَبَّكَ هُوَ ٱلۡخَلَّـٰقُ ٱلۡعَلِيمُ","translation_fr":"Ton Seigneur, c'est Lui vraiment le grand Créateur, l'Omniscient","translation_en":"Indeed, your Lord - He is the Knowing Creator","transliteration":"Inna rabbaka huwa alkhallaqu alAAaleemu"},{"id":87,"text":"وَلَقَدۡ ءَاتَيۡنَٰكَ سَبۡعٗا مِّنَ ٱلۡمَثَانِي وَٱلۡقُرۡءَانَ ٱلۡعَظِيمَ","translation_fr":"Nous t'avons certes donné «les sept versets que l'on répète», ainsi que le Coran sublime","translation_en":"And We have certainly given you, [O Muhammad], seven of the often repeated [verses] and the great Qur'an","transliteration":"Walaqad ataynaka sabAAan mina almathanee waalqurana alAAatheema"},{"id":88,"text":"لَا تَمُدَّنَّ عَيۡنَيۡكَ إِلَىٰ مَا مَتَّعۡنَا بِهِۦٓ أَزۡوَٰجٗا مِّنۡهُمۡ وَلَا تَحۡزَنۡ عَلَيۡهِمۡ وَٱخۡفِضۡ جَنَاحَكَ لِلۡمُؤۡمِنِينَ","translation_fr":"Ne regarde surtout pas avec envie les choses dont Nous avons donné jouissance temporaire à certains couples d'entre eux, ne t'afflige pas à leur sujet et abaisse ton aile pour les croyants","translation_en":"Do not extend your eyes toward that by which We have given enjoyment to [certain] categories of the disbelievers, and do not grieve over them. And lower your wing to the believers","transliteration":"La tamuddanna AAaynayka ila ma mattaAAna bihi azwajan minhum wala tahzan AAalayhim waikhfid janahaka lilmumineena"},{"id":89,"text":"وَقُلۡ إِنِّيٓ أَنَا ٱلنَّذِيرُ ٱلۡمُبِينُ","translation_fr":"Et dis: «Je suis l'avertisseur évident» (d'un châtiment)","translation_en":"And say, \"Indeed, I am the clear warner","transliteration":"Waqul innee ana alnnatheeru almubeenu"},{"id":90,"text":"كَمَآ أَنزَلۡنَا عَلَى ٱلۡمُقۡتَسِمِينَ","translation_fr":"De même que Nous avons fait descendre [le châtiment] sur ceux qui ont juré (entre eux)","translation_en":"Just as We had revealed [scriptures] to the separators","transliteration":"Kama anzalna AAala almuqtasimeena"},{"id":91,"text":"ٱلَّذِينَ جَعَلُواْ ٱلۡقُرۡءَانَ عِضِينَ","translation_fr":"ceux qui ont fait du Coran des fractions diverses, (pour créer des doutes)","translation_en":"Who have made the Qur'an into portions","transliteration":"Allatheena jaAAaloo alqurana AAideena"},{"id":92,"text":"فَوَرَبِّكَ لَنَسۡـَٔلَنَّهُمۡ أَجۡمَعِينَ","translation_fr":"Par ton Seigneur! Nous les interrogerons tous","translation_en":"So by your Lord, We will surely question them all","transliteration":"Fawarabbika lanasalannahum ajmaAAeena"},{"id":93,"text":"عَمَّا كَانُواْ يَعۡمَلُونَ","translation_fr":"sur ce qu'ils œuvraient","translation_en":"About what they used to do","transliteration":"AAamma kanoo yaAAmaloona"},{"id":94,"text":"فَٱصۡدَعۡ بِمَا تُؤۡمَرُ وَأَعۡرِضۡ عَنِ ٱلۡمُشۡرِكِينَ","translation_fr":"Expose donc clairement ce qu'on t'a commandé et détourne-toi des associateurs","translation_en":"Then declare what you are commanded and turn away from the polytheists","transliteration":"FaisdaAA bima tumaru waaAArid AAani almushrikeena"},{"id":95,"text":"إِنَّا كَفَيۡنَٰكَ ٱلۡمُسۡتَهۡزِءِينَ","translation_fr":"Nous t'avons effectivement défendu vis-à-vis des railleurs","translation_en":"Indeed, We are sufficient for you against the mockers","transliteration":"Inna kafaynaka almustahzieena"},{"id":96,"text":"ٱلَّذِينَ يَجۡعَلُونَ مَعَ ٱللَّهِ إِلَٰهًا ءَاخَرَۚ فَسَوۡفَ يَعۡلَمُونَ","translation_fr":"Ceux qui associent à Allah une autre divinité. Mais ils sauront bientôt","translation_en":"Who make [equal] with Allah another deity. But they are going to know","transliteration":"Allatheena yajAAaloona maAAa Allahi ilahan akhara fasawfa yaAAlamoona"},{"id":97,"text":"وَلَقَدۡ نَعۡلَمُ أَنَّكَ يَضِيقُ صَدۡرُكَ بِمَا يَقُولُونَ","translation_fr":"Et Nous savons certes que ta poitrine se serre, à cause de ce qu'ils disent","translation_en":"And We already know that your breast is constrained by what they say","transliteration":"Walaqad naAAlamu annaka yadeequ sadruka bima yaqooloona"},{"id":98,"text":"فَسَبِّحۡ بِحَمۡدِ رَبِّكَ وَكُن مِّنَ ٱلسَّـٰجِدِينَ","translation_fr":"Glorifie donc Ton Seigneur par Sa louange et sois de ceux qui se prosternent","translation_en":"So exalt [Allah] with praise of your Lord and be of those who prostrate [to Him]","transliteration":"Fasabbih bihamdi rabbika wakun mina alssajideena"},{"id":99,"text":"وَٱعۡبُدۡ رَبَّكَ حَتَّىٰ يَأۡتِيَكَ ٱلۡيَقِينُ","translation_fr":"et adore ton Seigneur jusqu'à ce que te vienne la certitude (la mort)","translation_en":"And worship your Lord until there comes to you the certainty (death)","transliteration":"WaoAAbud rabbaka hatta yatiyaka alyaqeenu"}]}